| 层 | 机制 | 失败行为 |
|----|------|----------|
| **pre-commit** | `scripts/install_git_hooks.sh` → `check-staged` + `verify_grid_chain_integrity.sh` | `git commit` 拒绝 |
| **CI** | `.github/workflows/grid-chain-integrity.yml` | merge 拒绝 |
| **runtime** | `scripts/start_grid_gateway.sh` → `verify-runtime` | **8501 拒绝启动** |

